// Dubnacos back home after the pardon.
=== start
Dubnacos is sitting outside the rampart, as Vellaunos said he would, mending a cattle halter. He looks up.

"Senovir won't speak to me. His wife spat on my shadow." He goes back to the halter. "It's better than the cave. Not much, but better."
* [flag pardon_oath] "I gave my word for you." -> oath
* "Keep the peace." -> peace
* "Goodbye." -> END

=== oath
"I know. Vellaunos made very sure I knew." He doesn't look up. "I don't break things I've been handed. Ask anyone. Well, don't ask Senovir."
* "Good." -> END

=== peace
"I'm keeping it. Look at me keeping it." He holds up the halter. "Thirty head of cattle. That's what a son costs. I'll be paying until I'm an old man."
* "Better than the cave." -> END
